# Super Suit has flash (CR 702.8): Bot1 attacks with the Grizzly Bears on turn 3 and, with the attack declared, flashes it
# in, {1}{U} paid exactly by Mox Sapphire and Mox Jet (the pool is empty). "Attach it to target creature you control. Untap
# that creature": the Bears, still attacking, are untapped, a 3/4 with the Suit, and deal 3 combat damage to Bot2 (CR 506.4).
# In the second main phase Equip {2}, paid exactly by Mox Emerald and Mox Ruby, moves it to an Ornithopter: a 1/4, the Bears
# a plain 2/2 again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Grizzly Bears
Super Suit
Island
Ornithopter
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Grizzly Bears > Bot2)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Super Suit.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Power = 3
? Combat.Attackers.Count = 1
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Super Suit.Activate(Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Battlefield.Super Suit.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Toughness = 2
